y affects the number of sales</b> your game will generate. The higher the s=
ales modifier of the selected platform is, the more sales you will get with=
 that target audience. <a href=3D"https://gamedevtycoon.fandom.com/wiki/Rev=
iew_Algorithm#Final_Score_calculation_and_post-treatment" class=3D"mw-redir=
ect" title=3D"Review Algorithm">-source</a>
</p><p>These combinations are covered in the table above.
