speed.
</p><p>Do only medium games for publishers - chose ones that have good roya=
lties (it can even outweight failure to meed high review plank, sometimes),=
 but make sure that genre/topic combo is good and fits the console (this is=
 not guaranteed).
</p><p>This makes you gain fans fast. Much faster than in garage.
</p><p>Do 1 training session after every game you make. More seems to have =
diminishing returns. Train in preferred stat (both stats for main hero) and=
 speed.
</p><p>When you gain 100k fans you can start self publishing medium games -=
