class=3D"entity-content"><p>I made only alternating Space Sim + Strategy ga=
mes on my first good run (just to avoid the penalty for same game type), an=
d both have the same slider requirements and need 1.6 tech to design ratio.=
 I had to hire people with Complex Algorithms and generally train for Tech =
specifically to get a good ratio, then trained for Speed to increase my abs=
olute T+D. It also looks like you can remove features from Design areas to =
skew the balance back to Tech, but bascially it's about the staff balance o=
f T to D more than anything. When you get closer to max, where they are the=
 same, the area being worked on or specilization only creates slightly more=
 bubble amounts for the related stat. If everyone has a 1:1 ratio in their =
stats, I think it may not be possible anymore to hit those ratios, I'm not =
even sure if the minimum ratio (1.2 T:D vs. the 1.6 ideal on the types I wo=
rk on) is possible in that case. Try removing all features from all Design =
centric areas.
