ame page with respect to what the source code is telling us.
</p><p>The current slider numbers are plain horrible. As an example, i<span=
 style=3D"font-size:13px;">f you want to achieve a 1.8 tech-to-design ratio=
, you should be maxing engine and AI, not gameplay and level design.&nbsp;<=
/span>
</p><p>Also, as I mentioned before, too many people are getting way too obs=
sessed on those damn sliders. It's only part of the equation and if you wan=
t to make 9+ games, the focus should be on increasing tech + design points =
via training and game engines. I can assure you that if your tech + design =
points do not improve, then no matter how well you align your sliders, you =
won't get a 9+ game.
