dium games and you can see the&nbsp;% of time each person spends. Basically=
: Set any bars with + to max. Then adjust the - bar to 20%. Any bar with no=
 symbol (blank) set to minimum. (15%) This will make sliders at max (if 2) =
40% each.
</p><p>Still figuring out the -- on casual though.
</p><p>But by using the above, and making sure none of my employees, myself=
 included do not go over 100% allocated work as well as cramming in the max=
