""><div class=3D"entity-content"><p>First of all dont look at sliders, look=
 at allocated time below in that horizontal bar. Ratio between those is wha=
ts matter.
</p><p>Then there are only 3 situations that can happen. You either need le=
ss than 20% or 21-40% or 40%+ depending what genere you have.
</p><p><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer noopener" class=3D"external t=
ext" href=3D"https://gamedevtycoon.fandom.com/wiki/Raw_Data_for_Review_Algo=
rithm#Development_Focus">Development_Focus</a>&nbsp; has values so you can =
see what sliders matters in each genere. Those values DO NOT reflect slider=
 positions, just simply NEED for certain feature. 1 and 0.9 has to be 41%+ =
time (horizontal bar + also 41%+ tech feutures you select on right - those =
you research) | 0.8 + 0.7 should be between 21-40% (same for right table op=
tions again) | 0.6 should be less than 20% time allocated (same for right t=
able options.
</p><p>KEEP in mind that with multigenere things ale slightly more complica=
ted, the game counts that 2/3 for first genere and 1/3 for second so action=
/strategy is not the same as strategy/action.
</p></div><div class=3D"EditedBy_edited-by__SMxZY">(Edited by WikiaBot)</di=
