=3D"entity-content"><p>game saves are saved in sqllite.
</p><p>its simple to do, but there is room for messing up so be careful.
</p><p>download sqlitebrowser_200_b1_win
</p><p>open sqllitebrowser
</p><p>located and open the "file__0.localstorage" file. Should be in AppDa=
ta\Local\Game Dev Tycoon\Local Storage (atleast on Win7)
</p><p>Go to browse data. You will see alot of rows with serialized data.
</p><p>You want to edit the "slot_1" or "slot_2" values.
</p><p>Go to <a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"nofollow noreferrer noopener" clas=
s=3D"external free" href=3D"http://www.jsoneditoronline.org/">http://www.js=
oneditoronline.org/</a>
</p><p>Paste in the data value, edit, paste back. Save. Start game tycoon.
</p><p>Note.. adding more momey in the slot_1 and slot2 will work, but in t=
he LOAD screen the money change will not be reflected (you will need to edi=
t "1" or "2" or "3" for that, but it's not required)
